{
  "$Comment": [
    "The base of an endless wave run: waves that never run out, each a little tougher than the last,",
    "a boss wave every few, and a breather between them. It is Abstract, so it never spawns on its own:",
    "a run is a Variant of it (Type Variant, Reference Zc_Encounter_Endless) that names what each band",
    "slot raises, stamped into the prefab of a dungeon whose Run.Endless says the schedule, the ramp and",
    "the chest. Give the Variant a binding row under Server/ZiggfreedCommon/Encounters, or the library",
    "keeps no run for it and nothing rises.",
    "",
    "  { \"Class\": \"EncounterManager\", \"Type\": \"Variant\", \"Reference\": \"Zc_Encounter_Endless\",",
    "    \"Modify\": { \"Band1\": \"Zc_Wave_Rise\", \"Band2\": \"Zc_Wave_Rise\",",
    "      \"Groups\": [ \"Undead\", \"My_Boss_Group\" ],",
    "      \"_ForwardedModifiers\": {",
    "        \"Band1\": { \"Role\": \"Skeleton_Fighter\", \"FarRole\": \"Skeleton_Archer\", \"NearDistance\": [ 5, 8 ] },",
    "        \"Band2\": { \"Role\": \"Zombie\", \"FarRole\": \"Zombie\", \"NearDistance\": [ 5, 8 ] },",
    "        \"BossWave\": { \"SpawnMarker\": \"My_Boss_Marker\", \"BarName\": \"npcs.My_Boss.name\" } } } }",
    "",
    "_ForwardedModifiers sits inside Modify, as every Variant's does; outside it the engine ignores it.",
    "BossWave is Zc_Boss_Wave_Rise unless the Variant names another: the boss rides out of a manual spawn",
    "marker in the prefab with his name on the boss bar (its comment tells how). To raise a boss on the",
    "spot instead, name Zc_Wave_Rise there with the boss as its Role.",
    "",
    "In order. A player comes within PlayerRange of the script's entity and Delay starts (long enough",
    "for an arrival's intro camera to end). Then a wave rises: the dungeon's schedule says which band",
    "slot raises it and at which size, read through the ziggfreedcommon:encounter_wave_band and",
    "encounter_wave_size readings, and on a boss wave (encounter_wave_boss) the BossWave slot raises it",
    "instead. A size is how many times the band's slot rises at once, so give a band's rows a range of",
    "distances (NearDistance [5, 8]) and a bigger size spreads out rather than stacking. Once one of the",
    "wave is seen and none of Groups is left alive within Range, the wave is beaten: zc:cleared tells the",
    "library, which banks it into each member's chest and shows them the next wave's number with the",
    "word that they may leave and keep their chest, and Breather seconds later the next wave rises. A",
    "wave none of which is ever seen (every spot blocked) is not beaten: after WatchSeconds the breather",
    "runs and the same wave rises again, so a failed spawn pays nothing. Players who fall come back for",
    "the next wave; nothing here resets on a death.",
    "",
    "The run ends when the dungeon says so (every member down at once, its time limit, or everyone gone):",
    "encounter_endless then reads 0, and every creature of Groups within Range is removed, so the party",
    "rises to a quiet area and their chest. Groups must hold everything the bands and the boss wave",
    "raise. Each raised creature takes the dungeon's ramp for the wave it rose in, a boss by his return;",
    "Mob Scaling and the binding row's Scale.Adds still apply to it."
  ],
